{"entries":[{"ID":"Intro_01","Speaker":"아들","Text_Ko":"훌쩍 훌쩍...","Text_En":"Sniff... Sniff..."},{"ID":"Intro_02","Speaker":"아들","Text_Ko":"훌쩍...","Text_En":"Sniff..."},{"ID":"Intro_03","Speaker":"아들","Text_Ko":"아빠...","Text_En":"Daddy"},{"ID":"Intro_04","Speaker":"아들","Text_Ko":"엄마는 어디간거야...?","Text_En":"Where did Mom go?"},{"ID":"Intro_06","Speaker":"아빠","Text_Ko":"엄마는 저기 별나라로 갔어","Text_En":"Mom went to the land of stars over there."},{"ID":"Intro_07","Speaker":"아들","Text_Ko":"별나라?","Text_En":"Land of stars?"},{"ID":"Intro_08","Speaker":"아빠","Text_Ko":"그래 하늘을 봐","Text_En":"Yeah, look at the sky."},{"ID":"Intro_09","Speaker":"아빠","Text_Ko":"저 많은 별들 보이지?","Text_En":"Can you see all those stars?"},{"ID":"Intro_10","Speaker":"아빠","Text_Ko":"엄마는 저 멀리 떠났어","Text_En":"Mom has gone far away."},{"ID":"Intro_11","Speaker":"아빠","Text_Ko":"한번 찾아볼래?","Text_En":"Want to check it out?"}]}